  tutorialText: 'When you have the Edit Tool (Q) selected:


    <b>Left Click</b>
    on an existing tower to mute, delete, or change the sound effect that tower plays


    <b>Drag
    and Drop</b> a tower to move its location


    <b>Right Click</b> on an existing
    tower to delete it

'
